Push him out, push him out. Harder, harder.

190
00:10:50,310 --> 00:10:52,600
Push him out, push him out. Way out.

191
00:10:52,770 --> 00:10:55,610
Let's get that ball and really move. Hey, hey. Ho, ho.

192
00:10:55,780 --> 00:10:56,860
Let's get...

